  unitName: Rognomus
  unitId: 40552
  unitNumber: 940
  description: A type of land dragon native to Ishgria known for its unusually sharp
    teeth. Although it is often surrounded when targeting prey, one fell swoop from
    its powerful tail is enough to knock out any opponent that stands in its way.
    The Rognomus prefers to hunt alone, though it sometimes emits a powerful roaring
    cry to call its herd when taking down larger prey. With a level of intellect
    better classified as animalistic, rather than demonic, this ferocious creature
    has been a challenge for humans to domesticate.
  summonDesc: I'm starved! If you don't<br>bring me somethin' to eat fast,<br>it's
    you who'll be on the menu!
  fusionDesc: No! It's not 'nuff! I need more!<br>Did ya really think that<br>was
    gonna do it for me?
